#: includes/Admin/PanelStrings.php:374
msgid ""
"1. In Bale, open @botfather, create a bot and copy its token.\n"
"2. Send any message to your bot (or add it to a group or channel as an admin).\n"
"3. Open tapi.bale.ai/bot<token>/getUpdates in your browser and copy the number after \"chat\":{\"id\":."
msgstr ""
"۱. در بله @botfather را باز کن، یک ربات بساز و توکنش را کپی کن.\n"
